{"explanation":"For a normal distribution, approximately 68% of values lie within 1 standard deviation of the mean, 95% within 2, and 99.7% within 3. The shaded area represents the probability of falling inside that interval. Drag either yellow endpoint to change the interval, or click a rule below the graph to jump to it.","manimCode":"const title = new Text({ text: 'The 68–95–99.7 rule', fontSize: 34, color: WHITE });
